('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect20_32.1','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect20_32',1,'大国主的五个名字','The five names of the Master of the Great Land','《古事记》在讲完须佐之男在出云建宫、娶栉名田比卖之后，接着列出了他的子孙：须佐之男和栉名田比卖生下八岛士奴美神，此后一代代往下传，传到天之冬衣神，天之冬衣神娶了刺国大神的女儿刺国若比卖，生下的就是这一部故事的主人公——从须佐之男往下数，正好是第六代。','After telling how Susanoo built his palace in Izumo and married Kushinada-hime, the Kojiki lists his descendants: their son Yashima-jinumi, and so on down the generations to Ame-no-fuyu-kinu, who married Sashikuni-waka-hime, daughter of the great deity of Sashikuni, and fathered the hero of this part — the sixth generation from Susanoo.','claim.v0350.kojiki_okuninushi.01',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect20_32.2','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect20_32',2,'稻羽的白兔','The white hare of Inaba','八十神都想娶稻羽的八上比卖，一起出发去求婚，让大穴牟迟背着袋子，像仆人一样跟在后面。','The Eighty Deities all wished to marry Princess Yakami of Inaba, and set out together, making Ōnamuji carry their bag like a servant.','claim.v0350.kojiki_okuninushi.02',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect20_32.3','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect20_32',3,'手间山的赤猪','The red boar of Mount Tema','八上比卖果然对八十神说：我不听你们的话，我要嫁给大穴牟迟。','Princess Yakami told the Eighty Deities: ''I will not listen to you.','claim.v0350.kojiki_okuninushi.03',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect20_32.4','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect20_32',4,'大树的裂缝','The cleft in the tree','八十神看见他又活了，再次设下圈套。','Seeing him alive again, the Eighty Deities set another trap.','claim.v0350.kojiki_okuninushi.04',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect20_32.5','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect20_32',5,'须势理毘卖与蛇室','Suseri-bime and the snake room','根之坚洲国——张伯伦译作“幽远之国”——就是当年须佐之男哭着要去的母亲之国，如今他住在这里。','The Nether-Distant-Land, the mother''s land that Susanoo had once wept to go to, was now his dwelling.','claim.v0350.kojiki_okuninushi.05',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect20_32.6','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect20_32',6,'蜈蚣与蜂之室','The room of centipedes and wasps','第二天晚上，须佐之男又让他睡在一间满是蜈蚣和马蜂的屋子里。','The next night Susanoo put him in a room full of centipedes and wasps.','claim.v0350.kojiki_okuninushi.06',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect20_32.7','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect20_32',7,'火烧原野与老鼠','The burning moor and the mouse','须佐之男又把一支鸣镝——箭头上装着中空的响器、射出去会呼啸作响的箭——射进一片大草原，命令大穴牟迟去把箭找回来。','Next Susanoo shot a whizzing arrow into a great moor and sent Ōnamuji to fetch it.','claim.v0350.kojiki_okuninushi.07',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect20_32.8','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect20_32',8,'头上的蜈蚣','Lice that were centipedes','须佐之男把大穴牟迟带回家里，叫进一间八寻宽的大屋子，让他替自己捉头上的虱子。','Susanoo took him back into the house, called him into a great room eight fathoms wide, and made him pick the lice from his head.','claim.v0350.kojiki_okuninushi.08',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect20_32.9','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect20_32',9,'生太刀、生弓矢与天诏琴','The sword of life, the bow and the speaking lute','大穴牟迟趁须佐之男睡着，把他的头发一缕缕绑在屋子的椽子上，用一块要五百个人才拉得动的大石头堵住屋门，背起妻子须势理毘卖，带上须佐之男的生太刀、生弓矢和天诏琴，逃了出去。','While Susanoo slept, Ōnamuji tied his hair to the rafters of the room, blocked the door with a rock that would take five hundred men to move, took his wife Suseri-bime on his back, and fled carrying Susanoo''s great sword of life, his bow and arrows of life, and his heavenly speaking lute.','claim.v0350.kojiki_okuninushi.09',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect20_32.10','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect20_32',10,'八千矛神的求婚之歌','The songs of the Deity of Eight Thousand Spears','以八千矛神为名的大国主，又到遥远的越国去向沼河比卖求婚。','As Yachihoko, the Deity of Eight Thousand Spears, he went to distant Koshi to woo Princess Nunakawa.','claim.v0350.kojiki_okuninushi.10',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect20_32.11','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect20_32',11,'少名毘古那','Sukuna-bikona','有一天，大国主在出云的美保岬，看见一位神乘着用萝藦豆荚做成的小船，踏着浪花漂过来，身上穿着用整张剥下来的小动物的皮做的衣服——原文的字一说是鹅，一说指飞蛾。','Once, at Cape Miho in Izumo, Ōkuninushi saw a deity riding the crests of the waves in a little boat made from a seed-pod of the kagami plant, clothed in the whole stripped skin of some small creature — the character is read by some as a goose and by others as a moth.','claim.v0350.kojiki_okuninushi.11',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect20_32.12','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect20_32',12,'御诸山的神','The deity of Mount Mimoro','少名毘古那走了，大国主忧愁地说：我一个人怎么能把这片国土造好呢？','With Sukuna-bikona gone, Ōkuninushi said in sorrow: ''How can I make this land alone?','claim.v0350.kojiki_okuninushi.12',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect20_32.13','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect20_32',13,'天若日子与雉鸣女','Ame-no-Wakahiko and the pheasant','天照大神说：丰苇原的瑞穗国应该由我的儿子天忍穗耳命来统治。','Amaterasu declared that the Luxuriant Reed-Plains Land of Fresh Rice-Ears should be ruled by her son Ame-no-oshi-ho-mimi.','claim.v0350.kojiki_okuninushi.13',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect20_32.14','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect20_32',14,'建御雷与让国','Takemikazuchi and the yielding of the land','众神最后派出了建御雷神，由天鸟船神陪同。','Last, the deities sent Takemikazuchi, with Ame-no-tori-fune.','claim.v0350.kojiki_okuninushi.14',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect33_43.1','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect33_43',1,'天孙降临的诏命','The command to descend','建御雷神回到天上，报告苇原中国已经平定。','Takemikazuchi went back up and reported that the Central Land of Reed-Plains had been pacified.','claim.v0350.kojiki_ninigi.01',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect33_43.2','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect33_43',2,'天之八衢的猿田毘古','Sarutahiko at the heavenly crossroads','迩迩艺命正要降临的时候，在天之八衢——天上八条道路交会的地方——站着一位神，他身上发出的光，向上照亮了高天原，向下照亮了苇原中国。','As Ninigi was about to descend, at the heavenly eight-forked crossroads stood a deity whose light shone up to the Plain of High Heaven and down to the Central Land of Reed-Plains.','claim.v0350.kojiki_ninigi.02',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect33_43.3','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect33_43',3,'神器与五伴绪','The regalia and the five chiefs','天照大神为迩迩艺命安排了五位随从的神，称为“五伴绪”：天儿屋命、布刀玉命、天宇受卖命、伊斯许理度卖命和玉祖命，他们都是当年在天之岩户前出过力的神。','Amaterasu assigned to Ninigi five attendant deities, the five chiefs of companies: Ame-no-koyane, Futo-tama, Ame-no-Uzume, Ishi-kori-dome and Tama-no-oya, all of whom had played their part before the Heavenly Rock-Dwelling.','claim.v0350.kojiki_ninigi.03',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect33_43.4','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect33_43',4,'降临高千穗','The descent on Takachiho','迩迩艺命离开了天上的岩座，分开天上层层叠叠的八重云，威风凛凛地开出一条道路，经过天之浮桥，降落在筑紫日向的高千穗的久士布流多气峰上。','Ninigi left the heavenly rock-seat, pushed apart the eight-fold heavenly clouds, and with mighty way-dividing made his way down by the Floating Bridge of Heaven to the peak of Kuji-furu-take of Takachiho in Himuka in Tsukushi.','claim.v0350.kojiki_ninigi.04',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect33_43.5','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect33_43',5,'猿女君与海参','The Duchesses of Saru and the sea-slug','迩迩艺命对天宇受卖命说：你送那位为我们引路的猿田毘古神回去吧。','Ninigi said to Ame-no-Uzume: ''Escort Sarutahiko, who served as our guide, back home.','claim.v0350.kojiki_ninigi.05',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect33_43.6','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect33_43',6,'木花之佐久夜毘卖与石长比卖','Konohana-sakuya-hime and Iwanaga-hime','迩迩艺命在笠沙的岬角遇见一位美丽的少女，问她是谁的女儿。','At the cape of Kasasa, Ninigi met a beautiful maiden and asked whose daughter she was.','claim.v0350.kojiki_ninigi.06',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect33_43.7','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect33_43',7,'火中生子','Children born in fire','过了些日子，木花之佐久夜毘卖来对迩迩艺命说：我怀孕了，就要生产了。','After some time Konohana-sakuya-hime came to Ninigi and said: ''I am with child and my time is near.','claim.v0350.kojiki_ninigi.07',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect33_43.8','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect33_43',8,'海幸与山幸','The luck of the sea and the luck of the mountains','火照命成了海幸彦，用鱼钩捕捞海里大大小小的鱼；火远理命成了山幸彦，用弓箭猎取山里大大小小的野兽。','Hoderi became the Luck of the Sea, catching fish broad of fin and narrow of fin with his hook; Hoori became the Luck of the Mountains, taking beasts rough of hair and soft of hair with his bow.','claim.v0350.kojiki_ninigi.08',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect33_43.9','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect33_43',9,'盐椎神与海神之宫','The salt deity and the road to the sea palace','火远理命在海边哭泣，这时盐椎神来了，问他：天津日高日子，你为什么哭？','As Hoori wept on the seashore, the salt deity Shio-tsuchi came and asked: ''Why do you weep, Sky''s Sun-Height?'' He told the story of the hook.','claim.v0350.kojiki_ninigi.09',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect33_43.10','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect33_43',10,'井边的玉与海神之女','The jewel in the vessel and the sea deity''s daughter','海神的女儿丰玉毘卖的侍女，拿着玉做的水器来井边打水，看见井水里映出了光，抬头一看，树上坐着一位英俊的男子，觉得十分奇怪。','A maid of the sea deity''s daughter Toyotama-bime came to the well with a jewelled vessel to draw water.','claim.v0350.kojiki_ninigi.10',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect33_43.11','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect33_43',11,'潮盈珠与潮干珠','The tide-flowing and tide-ebbing jewels','三年过去，火远理命想起往事，长长地叹了一口气。','After three years Hoori remembered the past and heaved a great sigh.','claim.v0350.kojiki_ninigi.11',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect33_43.12','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect33_43',12,'鸬鹚羽的产屋','The birth-hut thatched with cormorant feathers','后来，丰玉毘卖亲自从海里出来，对火远理命说：我怀孕了，现在就要生了。','Later Toyotama-bime herself came out of the sea and said to Hoori: ''I am with child and my time has come.','claim.v0350.kojiki_ninigi.12',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect79_90.1','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect79_90',1,'小碓命与兄长','Wo-usu and his elder brother','景行天皇在缠向的日代宫统治天下，他有许多儿子，其中有一对兄弟：哥哥叫大碓命，弟弟叫小碓命，也叫倭男具那命。','The Heavenly Sovereign Keikō ruled from the palace of Hishiro at Makimuku.','claim.v0350.kojiki_yamato_takeru.01',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect79_90.2','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect79_90',2,'少女装扮','Disguised as a girl','天皇说：西方有两个熊曾建，他们不肯归顺，没有礼数，你去把他们杀了。','The sovereign said: ''In the west there are two Kumaso bravoes who will not submit and have no respect.','claim.v0350.kojiki_yamato_takeru.02',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect79_90.3','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect79_90',3,'倭建的名号','The name Yamato Takeru','宴会正热闹的时候，小碓命从怀里拔出短剑，抓住哥哥熊曾建的衣领，一剑刺穿了他的胸膛。','When the feast was at its height, Wo-usu drew the sword from his bosom, seized the elder Kumaso bravo by the collar and thrust the sword through his chest.','claim.v0350.kojiki_yamato_takeru.03',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect79_90.4','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect79_90',4,'出云建与木刀','The Izumo bravo and the wooden sword','倭建命回京的路上，把山神、河神和海峡之神一一平定，然后进入出云国，想要杀死出云建。','On his way back Yamato Takeru subdued the deities of the mountains, the rivers and the straits, and then went into Izumo intending to kill the Izumo bravo.','claim.v0350.kojiki_yamato_takeru.04',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect79_90.5','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect79_90',5,'伊势的姑母','The aunt at Ise','倭建命刚刚回来，天皇又命令他说：你去把东方十二道那些凶暴的神和不肯归顺的人平定了。','No sooner had Yamato Takeru returned than the sovereign commanded him again: ''Go and subdue the savage deities and unsubmissive people of the twelve roads of the East.'' He sent with him Mi-suki-tomo-mimi-take-hiko, ancestor of the Kibi lords, and gave him a holly-wood spear eight fathoms long.','claim.v0350.kojiki_yamato_takeru.05',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect79_90.6','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect79_90',6,'相武的野火','The fire on the moor of Sagamu','倭建命到了尾张国，进了尾张国造的祖先美夜受比卖的家，本想娶她为妻，转念一想，等回来时再娶吧，就和她立下婚约，继续往东去了。','In Owari, Yamato Takeru entered the house of Miyazu-hime, ancestress of the rulers of Owari, and thought to marry her; then, deciding to marry her on his return, he pledged himself to her and went on east.','claim.v0350.kojiki_yamato_takeru.06',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect79_90.7','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect79_90',7,'弟橘比卖投海','Oto-tachibana-hime enters the sea','倭建命从那里出发，渡过走水海。','From there Yamato Takeru crossed the sea of Hashirimizu.','claim.v0350.kojiki_yamato_takeru.07',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect79_90.8','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect79_90',8,'足柄坂的白鹿','The white deer on the Ashigara pass','倭建命继续深入东方，把凶暴的虾夷人都平定了，又平定了山河间凶暴的神，然后踏上了回程。','Yamato Takeru went on deep into the East, subdued all the savage Emishi, pacified the savage deities of the mountains and rivers, and set out to return.','claim.v0350.kojiki_yamato_takeru.08',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect79_90.9','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect79_90',9,'酒折宫的火守老人','The old fire-keeper at Sakaori','倭建命越过足柄坂，进入甲斐国，住在酒折宫里。','Crossing from the pass into Kai, Yamato Takeru stayed at the palace of Sakaori.','claim.v0350.kojiki_yamato_takeru.09',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect79_90.10','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect79_90',10,'美夜受比卖与伊吹山','Miyazu-hime and Mount Ibuki','倭建命从甲斐越过科野，平定了科野坂的神，回到尾张，进了美夜受比卖的家，履行当初的约定。','From Kai Yamato Takeru crossed Shinano, subdued the deity of the Shinano pass, and came back to Owari, to Miyazu-hime''s house, to keep his pledge.','claim.v0350.kojiki_yamato_takeru.10',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect79_90.11','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect79_90',11,'三重的腿','Legs like a triple-bent rice cake','倭建命下了山，来到玉仓部的清泉边休息，神志稍稍清醒了一些，所以那眼泉被叫作居寤清水。','Coming down the mountain, he rested by the clear spring of Tamakurabe and his mind cleared a little, so the spring is called the Awakening Spring.','claim.v0350.kojiki_yamato_takeru.11',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect79_90.12','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect79_90',12,'思国之歌与白鸟','The songs of home and the white bird','到了能烦野，倭建命思念故乡，唱道：大和是国中最好的地方，层层叠叠的青山像垣墙一样环绕，大和啊，多么美好。','At the moor of Nobo, longing for his home, he sang: Yamato is the best of lands; the green mountains fold round it like a fence; Yamato, how lovely.','claim.v0350.kojiki_yamato_takeru.12',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_1_10.1','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_1_10',1,'大气之女与鸭蛋','The daughter of the air and the duck''s eggs','在最古老的时候，有一位少女，她是大气的女儿，名叫伊尔玛塔尔。','In the oldest times there was a maiden, daughter of the air, named Ilmatar.','claim.v0350.kal_1.01',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_1_10.2','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_1_10',2,'万奈莫宁的诞生','The birth of Väinämöinen','世界有了形状，伊尔玛塔尔又在海上漂了许多年，开始塑造大地的样子：她把手一指，就出现了岬角；用脚一踩，就有了鱼儿栖息的深坑；侧身一躺，就形成了平滑的海岸；她脚踏过的地方成了海湾，头枕过的地方成了港口。','With the world given shape, Ilmatar floated on for many years and began to form the land: where she pointed her hand, headlands rose; where she pressed with her foot, deep pools for the fish were made; where she lay on her side, smooth shores appeared; where her feet touched, bays were formed, and where her head rested, harbours.','claim.v0350.kal_1.02',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_1_10.3','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_1_10',3,'播种与大橡树','The sowing and the great oak','万奈莫宁上了岸，看见大地光秃秃的，什么也不长。','Coming ashore, Väinämöinen saw that the land was bare and nothing grew.','claim.v0350.kal_1.03',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_1_10.4','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_1_10',4,'约卡海宁的挑战','Joukahainen''s challenge','万奈莫宁的歌声和智慧传遍了四方。','The fame of Väinämöinen''s songs and wisdom spread far and wide.','claim.v0350.kal_1.04',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_1_10.5','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_1_10',5,'用妹妹换回性命','A sister for a life','约卡海宁陷在沼泽里，吓坏了，开始求饶。','Sunk in the swamp, Joukahainen was terrified and began to beg.','claim.v0350.kal_1.05',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_1_10.6','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_1_10',6,'艾诺的命运','The fate of Aino','艾诺到林中去折桦树枝做浴帚，在那里遇见了万奈莫宁。','Aino went into the woods to break birch twigs for a bath-whisk and met Väinämöinen there.','claim.v0350.kal_1.06',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_1_10.7','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_1_10',7,'鱼与失去的新娘','The fish and the lost bride','万奈莫宁听说艾诺死了，日夜悲伤。','Hearing that Aino was dead, Väinämöinen grieved day and night.','claim.v0350.kal_1.07',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_1_10.8','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_1_10',8,'约卡海宁的箭','Joukahainen''s arrows','万奈莫宁骑上一匹轻得像豆秆一样的马，踏着海浪向北方的波赫约拉出发。','Väinämöinen mounted a horse as light as a pea-stalk and set off over the waves for northern Pohjola.','claim.v0350.kal_1.08',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_1_10.9','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_1_10',9,'鹰与洛希','The eagle and Louhi','万奈莫宁在海上漂了许多天，又冷又饿，看不到岸。','Väinämöinen drifted on the sea for many days, cold and hungry, with no shore in sight.','claim.v0350.kal_1.09',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_1_10.10','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_1_10',10,'彩虹上的少女与斧伤','The maiden on the rainbow and the axe','万奈莫宁赶着雪橇往南走，忽然听见头顶传来织布机的声音。','Driving south in his sledge, Väinämöinen heard the sound of a loom above him.','claim.v0350.kal_1.10',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_1_10.11','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_1_10',11,'铁的起源','The origin of iron','万奈莫宁流着血，赶着雪橇去找能治伤的人。','Bleeding, Väinämöinen drove on in search of a healer.','claim.v0350.kal_1.11',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_1_10.12','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_1_10',12,'锻造三宝','The forging of the Sampo','万奈莫宁回到家，劝铁匠伊尔马里宁到北方去锻造三宝、娶波赫约拉的少女。','Back home, Väinämöinen urged the smith Ilmarinen to go north, forge the Sampo and win the maiden of Pohjola.','claim.v0350.kal_1.12',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_11_15.1','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_11_15',1,'萨里岛的花','The flower of Saari','勒明凯宁又叫阿赫蒂、考科米耶利，是一个英俊的年轻人，脸颊红润，头发漂亮，可是性情放荡不羁，眼睛总是在少女们身上打转。','Lemminkäinen, also called Ahti and Kaukomieli, was a handsome young man with ruddy cheeks and fine hair, but wild and reckless, his eyes always roving after the maidens.','claim.v0350.kal_2.01',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_11_15.2','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_11_15',2,'雪橇上的新娘','The bride in the sledge','有一天傍晚，少女们在林间空地上跳舞，基利基跳在最前面。','One evening the maidens were dancing in a forest glade with Kyllikki leading them.','claim.v0350.kal_2.02',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_11_15.3','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_11_15',3,'破誓','The broken vow','日子一天天过去，勒明凯宁常常出门去打鱼。','The days went by, and Lemminkäinen often went out fishing.','claim.v0350.kal_2.03',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_11_15.4','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_11_15',4,'流血的梳子','The bleeding brush','母亲苦苦劝他：不要去波赫约拉，那里的拉普兰巫师会用歌声把你唱进火里、唱进冰里，你一个人去会丢掉性命的。','His mother begged him: ''Do not go to Pohjola.','claim.v0350.kal_2.04',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_11_15.5','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_11_15',5,'巫师与盲牧人','The sorcerers and the blind herdsman','勒明凯宁来到波赫约拉，走进洛希的大厅，那里坐满了巫师和歌者，弹琴的弹琴，唱歌的唱歌。','Arriving in Pohjola, Lemminkäinen went into Louhi''s hall, which was full of sorcerers and singers playing and singing; they ignored the stranger.','claim.v0350.kal_2.05',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_11_15.6','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_11_15',6,'希西的麋鹿','The elk of Hiisi','勒明凯宁向洛希求娶她的女儿。','Lemminkäinen asked Louhi for her daughter.','claim.v0350.kal_2.06',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_11_15.7','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_11_15',7,'森林之神','The gods of the forest','勒明凯宁修好了滑雪板，这一次他不再夸口，而是向森林之神祈祷。','Lemminkäinen mended his skis, and this time, instead of boasting, he prayed to the forest gods.','claim.v0350.kal_2.07',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_11_15.8','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_11_15',8,'火焰之马','The fire-breathing horse','洛希说：你去把希西那匹棕色的骟马套上笼头，它在希西的原野上奔跑，鼻孔里喷着火，嘴里冒着烟。','Louhi said: ''Go and bridle the brown gelding of Hiisi, which runs on Hiisi''s meadows breathing fire from its nostrils and smoke from its mouth.'' Lemminkäinen set out with a golden halter and a silver bridle.','claim.v0350.kal_2.08',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_11_15.9','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_11_15',9,'图奥内拉的天鹅','The swan of Tuonela','洛希说：你去图奥内拉的黑河上，只射一箭，射死那里的天鹅，我就把女儿给你。','Louhi said: ''Go to the black river of Tuonela, and with a single arrow shoot the swan there; then my daughter shall be yours.'' Tuonela was the land of the dead, and the black river lay in the realm of Tuoni, lord of the dead.','claim.v0350.kal_2.09',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_11_15.10','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_11_15',10,'黑河里的碎片','The pieces in the black river','盲眼牧人把奄奄一息的勒明凯宁扔进了图奥内拉的黑河里，河水把他卷向汹涌的瀑布。','The blind herdsman threw the dying Lemminkäinen into the black river of Tuonela, and the current swept him towards the roaring falls.','claim.v0350.kal_2.10',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_11_15.11','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_11_15',11,'母亲的寻找','The mother''s search','在勒明凯宁的家里，母亲每天都看着那把梳子。','At home, Lemminkäinen''s mother watched the brush every day.','claim.v0350.kal_2.11',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_11_15.12','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_11_15',12,'铜耙与蜜蜂','The copper rake and the bee','母亲哭着去找铁匠伊尔马里宁，请他打一把耙子：铜的耙齿要一百寻长，耙柄要五百寻长。','Weeping, the mother went to the smith Ilmarinen and asked for a rake with copper teeth a hundred fathoms long and a handle five hundred fathoms long, and Ilmarinen forged it.','claim.v0350.kal_2.12',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_31_36.1','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_31_36',1,'两兄弟的仇恨','The brothers'' feud','从前，有一位母亲养大了一窝小鸡，一只被带到了俄罗斯，一只被带到了卡累利阿，还有一只留在家里——诗人用这样的比喻开始讲述两兄弟的故事。','Once, the poem begins, a mother raised a brood of chicks: one was carried to Russia, one to Karelia, and one stayed at home — with such an image the singer opens the tale of two brothers.','claim.v0350.kal_3.01',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_31_36.2','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_31_36',2,'摇篮里的复仇者','The avenger in the cradle','那个女子在温塔莫家里生下了一个男孩，母亲给他取名叫库勒沃，温塔莫的人则叫他“战争之子”。','In Untamo''s house the woman bore a son.','claim.v0350.kal_3.02',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_31_36.3','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_31_36',3,'杀不死的孩子','The child who could not be killed','温塔莫先叫人做了一只木桶，把库勒沃装进去，扔进了湖里。','First Untamo had a barrel made, shut Kullervo inside and threw him into the lake.','claim.v0350.kal_3.03',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_31_36.4','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_31_36',4,'无用的仆人','The useless servant','温塔莫给库勒沃派活。','Untamo set Kullervo to work.','claim.v0350.kal_3.04',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_31_36.5','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_31_36',5,'藏着石头的面包','The bread with a stone in it','伊尔马里宁的妻子，就是当年那位波赫约拉的少女，如今是铁匠家的女主人。','Ilmarinen''s wife — the maiden of Pohjola of old, now mistress of the smith''s house — looked at the new slave and thought: let him herd the cattle.','claim.v0350.kal_3.05',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_31_36.6','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_31_36',6,'断刀','The broken knife','到了中午，库勒沃坐在山坡上，拿出主妇给的面包，用刀一切，刀刃碰到了中间的石头，啪的一声折断了。','At noon Kullervo sat down on a hillside, took out the mistress''s loaf and cut into it; the blade struck the stone in the middle and snapped.','claim.v0350.kal_3.06',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_31_36.7','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_31_36',7,'主妇之死','The death of the mistress','傍晚，库勒沃把那群“牛”赶进了牛栏，号角声响彻四方。','At evening Kullervo drove his ''cattle'' into the byre, the horn sounding far and wide.','claim.v0350.kal_3.07',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_31_36.8','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_31_36',8,'找到父母','Finding his parents','库勒沃在森林里游荡，心中充满了悲伤和愤怒。','Kullervo wandered in the forest, full of grief and anger.','claim.v0350.kal_3.08',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_31_36.9','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_31_36',9,'路上的少女','The maiden on the road','回到家里，库勒沃想帮父母干活，却什么也干不好：父亲让他划船，他把船桨划断了，把船底都划穿了；让他撒网捕鱼，他把水搅成了泥浆，把渔网撕成了碎片。','Back home, Kullervo tried to help his parents but could do nothing right.','claim.v0350.kal_3.09',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_31_36.10','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_31_36',10,'急流','The rapids','少女明白了一切，悲痛欲绝。','The maiden understood everything and was overcome with grief.','claim.v0350.kal_3.10',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_31_36.11','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_31_36',11,'出征与复仇','War and vengeance','库勒沃准备出征，他一个个地问家人：我死了，你们会为我哭泣吗？','As he made ready for war, Kullervo asked each of his family: ''When I die, will you weep for me?'' His father said: ''No; I will beget a better son.'' His brother said: ''No; I will find a better brother.'' His sister said: ''No; I will find a better brother.'' Only his mother said: ''I will weep for you, in the house and in the fields and everywhere, until my tears run dry.'' Kullervo set out.','claim.v0350.kal_3.11',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_31_36.12','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_31_36',12,'卡勒沃之子的结局','The end of Kalervo''s son','库勒沃回到家里，家中空无一人，炉灶冰冷，父亲、母亲、兄弟和姐妹都已经死去。','Kullervo came home to find the house empty and the hearth cold; father, mother, brother and sister were all dead.','claim.v0350.kal_3.12',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_39_43.1','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_39_43',1,'宝剑与哭泣的船','The sword and the weeping boat','伊尔马里宁失去了妻子，悲伤了很久。','Ilmarinen grieved long for his lost wife.','claim.v0350.kal_4.01',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_39_43.2','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_39_43',2,'勒明凯宁加入','Lemminkäinen joins them','船经过一座岬角时，岸上有人在喊：是谁在海上航行？','As the boat passed a headland, someone on the shore called out: ''Who is sailing on the sea?'' It was Lemminkäinen.','claim.v0350.kal_4.02',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_39_43.3','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_39_43',3,'大梭鱼','The great pike','船驶进一段湍急的河道，在急流和瀑布之间穿行。','The boat ran into a stretch of wild river, threading between rapids and falls.','claim.v0350.kal_4.03',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_39_43.4','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_39_43',4,'第一把康特勒琴','The first kantele','万奈莫宁看着那堆鱼骨，心想：这些骨头要是做成一件东西，会是什么样子？','Looking at the heap of bones, Väinämöinen wondered what they might become.','claim.v0350.kal_4.04',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_39_43.5','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_39_43',5,'万物倾听','All creatures listen','万奈莫宁洗净双手，坐在一块歌唱的石头上，把康特勒琴放在膝上，用手指拨动琴弦。','Väinämöinen washed his hands, sat down on a stone of singing, set the kantele on his knee and plucked the strings with his fingers.','claim.v0350.kal_4.05',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_39_43.6','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_39_43',6,'泪珠','The tears that became pearls','所有听见琴声的人都哭了：年轻的人哭了，老人哭了，男人和女人都哭了，连小孩子也哭了。','Everyone who heard the music wept: the young and the old, men and women, even the little children.','claim.v0350.kal_4.06',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_39_43.7','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_39_43',7,'唱睡波赫约拉','Singing Pohjola to sleep','船终于到了波赫约拉。','At last the boat reached Pohjola.','claim.v0350.kal_4.07',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_39_43.8','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_39_43',8,'挖出三宝','Digging out the Sampo','英雄们来到波赫约拉的铜山前，三宝就锁在山里的九道门后。','The heroes came to the copper mountain of Pohjola, where the Sampo was locked behind nine doors.','claim.v0350.kal_4.08',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_39_43.9','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_39_43',9,'鹤的叫声','The crane''s cry','船在海上平稳地航行，三宝藏在船舱里，三位英雄心里都很高兴。','The boat sailed smoothly over the sea with the Sampo hidden in the hold, and the three heroes were glad.','claim.v0350.kal_4.09',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_39_43.10','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_39_43',10,'雾、海怪与风暴','Fog, the sea monster and the storm','洛希大怒，施展魔法追赶英雄们。','Louhi in her fury worked magic to pursue the heroes.','claim.v0350.kal_4.10',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_39_43.11','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_39_43',11,'鹰形的洛希','Louhi as an eagle','洛希造了一艘巨大的战船，让上百名武士带着刀剑和弓箭上船，亲自率领他们追赶。','Louhi built a great war-ship, put a hundred warriors aboard with swords, bows and arrows, and led the pursuit herself.','claim.v0350.kal_4.11',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.finnish_kalevala_crawford_39_43.12','storyver.finnish.kalevala_crawford_39_43',12,'三宝的碎片','The fragments of the Sampo','洛希虽然失去了爪子，却不肯罢休。','Though she had lost her talons, Louhi would not give up.','claim.v0350.kal_4.12',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_nala.1','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_nala',1,'坚战的悲叹','Yudhiṣṭhira''s lament','般度族的长兄坚战在掷骰中输掉了王国，带着四个弟弟和妻子黑公主流放到森林里，要在那里度过十二年，再隐姓埋名过一年。','Yudhiṣṭhira, eldest of the Pāṇḍava brothers, had lost his kingdom at dice and gone into exile in the forest with his four brothers and their wife Draupadī, to spend twelve years there and a thirteenth in hiding.','claim.v0350.mbh_nala.01',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_nala.2','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_nala',2,'天鹅传情','The swans'' message','从前，尼沙陀国有一位国王，名叫那罗，是英雄维罗森那的儿子。','Long ago there was a king of the Nishadhas named Nala, son of Vīrasena.','claim.v0350.mbh_nala.02',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_nala.3','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_nala',3,'四位天神','The four gods','达摩衍蒂从此心神不宁，日渐消瘦。','Damayantī grew restless and pale.','claim.v0350.mbh_nala.03',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_nala.4','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_nala',4,'使者那罗','Nala the messenger','天神让那罗隐去身形，他一路畅通无阻地走进了毗陀婆王宫的后宫。','The gods made Nala invisible, and he passed unhindered into the inner palace of Vidarbha.','claim.v0350.mbh_nala.04',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_nala.5','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_nala',5,'五个那罗','Five Nalas','选婿大会的日子到了。','The day of the svayaṃvara came.','claim.v0350.mbh_nala.05',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_nala.6','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_nala',6,'迦利的怨恨','Kali''s grudge','四位天神没有生气，他们都很高兴，各自赐给那罗两个恩惠：因陀罗让他在祭祀时能亲眼看见天神，并能到达天界；阿耆尼让他想要火的时候火就会出现，并让他拥有像火一样光明的世界；阎摩赐给他烹调的美味和对正法的坚定；伐楼那让他想要水的时候水就会出现，并赐给他永不凋谢的花环。','The four gods were not angry but pleased, and each gave Nala two boons: Indra, that he would see the gods with his own eyes at sacrifices and reach the heavenly worlds; Agni, that fire would appear whenever he wished and that he would have worlds bright as fire; Yama, skill in fine cooking and steadfastness in dharma; Varuṇa, that water would appear whenever he wished, and garlands that never faded.','claim.v0350.mbh_nala.06',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_nala.7','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_nala',7,'掷骰失国','The kingdom lost at dice','迦利来到尼沙陀，等着那罗犯下一个过失。','Kali came to Nishadha and waited for Nala to commit some fault.','claim.v0350.mbh_nala.07',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_nala.8','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_nala',8,'森林中的分离','Parting in the forest','补湿迦罗下令：谁要是收留那罗，就处死谁。','Pushkara proclaimed that anyone who sheltered Nala would die.','claim.v0350.mbh_nala.08',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_nala.9','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_nala',9,'达摩衍蒂的漂泊','Damayantī''s wanderings','达摩衍蒂醒来，不见了丈夫，哭喊着在森林里四处寻找。','Damayantī woke to find her husband gone and searched the forest weeping and calling.','claim.v0350.mbh_nala.09',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_nala.10','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_nala',10,'迦尔郭吒迦','Karkoṭaka','那罗离开妻子以后，在森林里看见一场大火，火中有声音喊道：那罗，快来救我！','After leaving his wife, Nala saw a great fire in the forest, and from it a voice cried: ''Nala, come and save me!'' He went into the fire and found a huge serpent coiled there, the nāga king Karkoṭaka, who said: ''Cursed by the sage Nārada, I cannot move; only you can save me.','claim.v0350.mbh_nala.10',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_nala.11','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_nala',11,'寻找那罗','The search for Nala','那罗以巴胡迦的名字在阿逾陀做了利图帕尔纳的车夫，掌管马厩。','As Bāhuka, Nala served Ṛtuparṇa at Ayodhyā as his charioteer and master of the stables.','claim.v0350.mbh_nala.11',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_nala.12','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_nala',12,'百由旬的车程与骰子的学问','The hundred-yojana drive and the science of dice','达摩衍蒂听了帕尔纳达的报告，心里明白了，就想出一个办法。','Hearing Parṇāda''s report, Damayantī understood and devised a plan.','claim.v0350.mbh_nala.12',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_nala.13','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_nala',13,'相认','Recognition','利图帕尔纳的车隆隆地驶进毗陀婆的都城，车声震动了宫殿，达摩衍蒂一听就知道，只有那罗能把车驾得这样快。','Ṛtuparṇa''s chariot thundered into the capital of Vidarbha, the noise shaking the palace, and Damayantī knew at once that only Nala drove like that.','claim.v0350.mbh_nala.13',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_nala.14','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_nala',14,'赢回王国','The kingdom won back','利图帕尔纳知道了真相，向那罗道歉，那罗也把驾驭马匹的学问教给了他，两人友好地分别。','Learning the truth, Ṛtuparṇa asked Nala''s pardon; Nala taught him the science of horses, and they parted friends.','claim.v0350.mbh_nala.14',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_savitri.1','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_savitri',1,'马主王的祈求','King Aśvapati''s prayer','坚战在森林里问仙人摩根德耶：世上可曾有过像我们的黑公主那样贤德、那样忠于丈夫的女子？','In the forest Yudhiṣṭhira asked the sage Mārkaṇḍeya: ''Has there ever been a woman as virtuous and as devoted to her husband as our Draupadī?'' ''There has, king,'' said Mārkaṇḍeya; ''hear the story of Sāvitrī.','claim.v0350.mbh_savitri.01',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_savitri.2','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_savitri',2,'女神的恩赐','The goddess''s gift','马主王说：女神啊，我所求的只是子嗣，为了延续家族，我才守戒修行。','Aśvapati said: ''Goddess, I ask only for offspring; it was for the continuance of my line that I kept these vows.','claim.v0350.mbh_savitri.02',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_savitri.3','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_savitri',3,'自己去选','Sent to choose for herself','莎维德丽到了出嫁的年纪，可她的美丽和光彩让所有的人都望而却步，竟然没有一个人敢来向她求婚。','Sāvitrī came of age to marry, but her beauty and radiance daunted everyone, and no one dared to ask for her hand.','claim.v0350.mbh_savitri.03',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_savitri.4','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_savitri',4,'那罗陀的预言','Nārada''s prophecy','过了一些日子，莎维德丽回来了。','Some time later Sāvitrī returned.','claim.v0350.mbh_savitri.04',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_savitri.5','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_savitri',5,'不改的心意','A choice made once','马主王听了，对女儿说：莎维德丽，你去另选一个丈夫吧，萨谛梵这个缺点盖过了他所有的美德，一年之后他就会死去。','Aśvapati said to his daughter: ''Sāvitrī, go and choose another husband.','claim.v0350.mbh_savitri.05',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_savitri.6','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_savitri',6,'林中的婚姻','A marriage in the forest','马主王选了一个吉日，带着婆罗门和祭司，用车载着结婚的用品，带着莎维德丽来到迪尤摩特舍那所住的净修林。','On an auspicious day Aśvapati, with brahmins and priests and chariots laden with things for the wedding, brought Sāvitrī to the hermitage where Dyumatsena lived.','claim.v0350.mbh_savitri.06',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_savitri.7','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_savitri',7,'三夜的斋戒','The three-night fast','日子一天天过去，在快乐的净修林生活里，莎维德丽的心中却始终压着那罗陀的话，日日夜夜地数着日子。','The days went by in the happy hermitage life, but Nārada''s words weighed on Sāvitrī''s heart, and day and night she counted the days, telling no one.','claim.v0350.mbh_savitri.07',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_savitri.8','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_savitri',8,'最后一天','The last day','那一天，萨谛梵扛起斧头，要到林中去砍柴、采果子。','That day Satyavān shouldered his axe to go into the forest for wood and fruit.','claim.v0350.mbh_savitri.08',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_savitri.9','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_savitri',9,'阎摩的绳索','Yama''s noose','萨谛梵采了果子，装满了篮子，又开始砍柴。','Satyavān gathered fruit and filled his basket, then began to cut wood.','claim.v0350.mbh_savitri.09',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_savitri.10','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_savitri',10,'跟随死神','Following death','莎维德丽悲伤地跟在阎摩身后走去。','Sorrowing, Sāvitrī followed Yama.','claim.v0350.mbh_savitri.10',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_savitri.11','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_savitri',11,'五个恩惠','Five boons','莎维德丽一边走，一边继续说话：与善人相处，哪怕只有一次，也是值得追求的；和善人交朋友，比什么都可贵，所以人应该和善人在一起。','As she walked Sāvitrī spoke on: ''To meet the good even once is to be sought; friendship with the good is above all things; so one should keep company with the good.'' ''Your words profit even the wise,'' said Yama; ''ask a second boon, except Satyavān''s life.'' ''Let my father-in-law regain his lost kingdom and never stray from dharma.'' Yama granted it and again bade her return.','claim.v0350.mbh_savitri.11',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_savitri.12','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_savitri',12,'黑夜里的归途','The way home through the night','阎摩解开了绳索，带着灵魂离去，并告诉莎维德丽，萨谛梵将活四百年，与她一起享受幸福。','Yama loosened the noose and departed, telling Sāvitrī that Satyavān would live four hundred years and share happiness with her.','claim.v0350.mbh_savitri.12',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_savitri.13','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_savitri',13,'净修林中的光明','Light in the hermitage','就在那天，盲王迪尤摩特舍那忽然重见了光明。','That same day the blind king Dyumatsena suddenly regained his sight.','claim.v0350.mbh_savitri.13',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra.1','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra',1,'黑天的和平使命','Kṛṣṇa''s embassy of peace','般度五子在森林里过了十二年，又在毗罗吒国隐姓埋名地度过了第十三年，按照当年掷骰子时的约定，他们应该收回自己的王国。','The Pāṇḍavas had spent twelve years in the forest and a thirteenth in hiding at the court of Virāṭa; by the terms of the dice game they should now have their kingdom back.','claim.v0350.mbh_kurukshetra.01',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra.2','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra',2,'战车上的阿周那','Arjuna on the chariot','两军在俱卢之野——一片被称为“正法之野”的平原——上摆开了阵势：般度族七支大军，俱卢族十一支大军，旌旗蔽日，战鼓和螺号响彻天地。','The armies drew up on the field of Kurukṣetra, the plain called the field of dharma: seven armies of the Pāṇḍavas, eleven of the Kauravas, banners darkening the sun, drums and conches shaking heaven and earth.','claim.v0350.mbh_kurukshetra.02',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra.3','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra',3,'毗湿摩的箭床','Bhīṣma''s bed of arrows','俱卢族的第一位统帅是年老的毗湿摩。','The first commander of the Kauravas was old Bhīṣma, son of the river goddess Gaṅgā, who in his youth had vowed for his father''s sake never to marry or claim the throne, and had been granted the boon of choosing the hour of his own death.','claim.v0350.mbh_kurukshetra.03',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra.4','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra',4,'激昂与轮阵','Abhimanyu and the circular array','毗湿摩倒下以后，德罗纳做了俱卢族的统帅。','After Bhīṣma fell, Droṇa took command of the Kauravas.','claim.v0350.mbh_kurukshetra.04',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra.5','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra',5,'阿周那的誓言','Arjuna''s vow','阿周那回到营地，得知儿子战死，又听说是胜车在阵口挡住了救兵，悲痛欲绝，当众立下誓言：明天日落之前，我一定要杀死胜车；如果做不到，我就投火自焚。','When Arjuna returned to camp and learned that his son had fallen and that Jayadratha had held back the rescuers at the breach, he was beside himself with grief and vowed before all: ''Before sunset tomorrow I will kill Jayadratha; if I fail, I will enter the fire.'' When the news reached the Kauravas, Jayadratha in terror wanted to flee, but Droṇa promised to protect him and hid him at the very rear of the host behind array upon array.','claim.v0350.mbh_kurukshetra.05',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra.6','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra',6,'瓶首之死','The death of Ghaṭotkaca','那一夜，战斗没有停止，两军举着火把在黑暗中继续厮杀。','That night the fighting did not stop; the armies fought on in the dark by torchlight.','claim.v0350.mbh_kurukshetra.06',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra.7','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra',7,'马嘶死了','''Aśvatthāman is dead''','第十五天，德罗纳在战场上无人能敌，用神兵杀死了大批般度族的士兵。','On the fifteenth day Droṇa was invincible, slaying hosts of Pāṇḍava soldiers with his divine weapons.','claim.v0350.mbh_kurukshetra.07',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra.8','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra',8,'迦尔纳的车轮','Karṇa''s chariot wheel','德罗纳死后，迦尔纳做了俱卢族的统帅。','After Droṇa''s death Karṇa took command of the Kauravas.','claim.v0350.mbh_kurukshetra.08',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra.9','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra',9,'难敌藏身湖中','Duryodhana hides in the lake','第十八天，沙利耶做了俱卢族最后一位统帅，被坚战亲手杀死；那个在掷骰时设下骗局的沙恭尼，也被般度五子中最小的偶天杀死。','On the eighteenth day Śalya, last commander of the Kauravas, was slain by Yudhiṣṭhira himself, and Śakuni, who had rigged the dice, was slain by Sahadeva, youngest of the Pāṇḍavas.','claim.v0350.mbh_kurukshetra.09',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra.10','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra',10,'杵战','The mace duel','怖军和难敌拿着铁杵在湖边对战，两人的杵碰撞时迸出火花，声音像霹雳一样。','Bhīma and Duryodhana fought with iron maces by the lake, the clash striking sparks and sounding like thunder.','claim.v0350.mbh_kurukshetra.10',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra.11','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra',11,'夜袭','The night raid','俱卢族只剩下三个人还活着：德罗纳的儿子马嘶、慈悯和成铠。','Of the Kauravas only three remained alive: Droṇa''s son Aśvatthāman, Kṛpa and Kṛtavarman.','claim.v0350.mbh_kurukshetra.11',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.hindu_mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra.12','storyver.hindu.mahabharata_ganguli_kurukshetra',12,'战后的寂静','The silence after the war','第二天清晨，黑公主得知五个儿子都被杀死，悲痛欲绝，发誓说：如果马嘶不受惩罚，我就绝食而死。','The next morning Draupadī learned that all five of her sons were dead and, beside herself with grief, vowed to fast to death unless Aśvatthāman were punished.','claim.v0350.mbh_kurukshetra.12',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_zal_rostam.1','storyver.persian.zimmern_zal_rostam',1,'白发之子','The white-haired son','在马努切赫尔国王统治伊朗的时候，扎布尔斯坦的领主萨姆是国王最英勇的勇士，他什么都不缺，只盼望有一个儿子。','When King Manūchehr ruled Iran, Sām, lord of Zābulistān, was the bravest of his champions; he lacked nothing except a son.','claim.v0350.shn_zal.01',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_zal_rostam.2','storyver.persian.zimmern_zal_rostam',2,'西摩格的巢','The Simorgh''s nest','厄尔布尔士山的高处，住着一只神鸟，名叫西摩格。','High on Mount Alborz lived a great bird called the Simorgh.','claim.v0350.shn_zal.02',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_zal_rostam.3','storyver.persian.zimmern_zal_rostam',3,'萨姆的梦','Sām''s dream','有一天夜里，萨姆梦见一个骑着阿拉伯骏马的人从印度方向疾驰而来，告诉他：你的儿子还活着。','One night Sām dreamed that a rider on an Arab horse came galloping from the direction of India and told him: ''Your son is alive.'' He woke and told the priests his dream, asking what it meant.','claim.v0350.shn_zal.03',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_zal_rostam.4','storyver.persian.zimmern_zal_rostam',4,'扎尔回到人间','Zāl returns to the world of men','西摩格看见山下的萨姆，知道他是来找儿子的。','The Simorgh saw Sām below and knew he had come for his son.','claim.v0350.shn_zal.04',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_zal_rostam.5','storyver.persian.zimmern_zal_rostam',5,'喀布尔的公主','The princess of Kābul','萨姆奉国王之命出征，把扎布尔斯坦交给扎尔治理。','Sent by the king to war, Sām left Zābulistān in Zāl''s charge.','claim.v0350.shn_zal.05',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_zal_rostam.6','storyver.persian.zimmern_zal_rostam',6,'长发之绳','The rope of hair','鲁达贝的侍女们装作去采玫瑰，来到扎尔营地附近的河边。','Rūdābeh''s maidens went out as if to gather roses by the river near Zāl''s camp.','claim.v0350.shn_zal.06',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_zal_rostam.7','storyver.persian.zimmern_zal_rostam',7,'父亲与国王的反对','The opposition of father and king','扎尔召来祭司和贤者，把心事告诉了他们，他们都沉默不语，因为谁都知道梅赫拉布是佐哈克的后裔，伊朗的英雄怎能和暴君的子孙结亲？','Zāl summoned the priests and wise men and told them his heart, but they were silent, for all knew Mehrāb descended from Zahhāk; how could a hero of Iran marry into the tyrant''s line?','claim.v0350.shn_zal.07',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_zal_rostam.8','storyver.persian.zimmern_zal_rostam',8,'王后的出使','The queen''s embassy','消息传到喀布尔，梅赫拉布才知道女儿的事，他勃然大怒，拔出剑来要杀死鲁达贝，说她给全族带来了灭顶之灾。','When the news reached Kābul, Mehrāb learned for the first time of his daughter''s love.','claim.v0350.shn_zal.08',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_zal_rostam.9','storyver.persian.zimmern_zal_rostam',9,'智者的谜语','The riddles of the wise men','扎尔来到马努切赫尔的宫廷，国王让宫中的智者们用谜语来考验他。','At Manūchehr''s court the king had his wise men test Zāl with riddles.','claim.v0350.shn_zal.09',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_zal_rostam.10','storyver.persian.zimmern_zal_rostam',10,'婚礼','The wedding','扎尔带着国王的许可，日夜兼程回到扎布尔斯坦，又赶往喀布尔。','With the king''s consent Zāl rode day and night back to Zābulistān and on to Kābul.','claim.v0350.shn_zal.10',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_zal_rostam.11','storyver.persian.zimmern_zal_rostam',11,'难产与西摩格的羽毛','The hard labour and the Simorgh''s feather','不久，鲁达贝怀了孕。','Soon Rūdābeh was with child.','claim.v0350.shn_zal.11',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_zal_rostam.12','storyver.persian.zimmern_zal_rostam',12,'白象与拉赫什','The white elephant and Rakhsh','鲁斯塔姆长得飞快，十个乳母都喂不饱他，断奶以后，他一个人吃的饭比五个大人还多。','Rostam grew so fast that ten nurses could not satisfy him, and once weaned he ate more than five grown men.','claim.v0350.shn_zal.12',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_mazinderan.1','storyver.persian.zimmern_mazinderan',1,'魔鬼歌手','The demon minstrel','凯·卡乌斯继承了伊朗的王位，坐在宝座上，看着满朝的勇士和堆积如山的财宝，以为天下再也没有人比他更强大。','Kay Kāvus inherited the throne of Iran and, seated in state with his champions around him and treasure heaped high, thought no one in the world more mighty than he.','claim.v0350.shn_seven.01',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_mazinderan.2','storyver.persian.zimmern_mazinderan',2,'白魔的冰雹','The White Demon''s hail','扎尔赶到宫中，恳切地劝国王：马赞德兰是魔鬼的国度，他们会用魔法迷惑人，以前的国王都不敢去，你不要拿伊朗的勇士和自己的性命去冒险。','Zāl hastened to court and earnestly urged the king: ''Māzandarān is the land of demons; they bewitch men with magic.','claim.v0350.shn_seven.02',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_mazinderan.3','storyver.persian.zimmern_mazinderan',3,'两条路与狮子','Two roads, and the lion','扎尔收到信，对儿子鲁斯塔姆说：国王落难了，只有你能救他。','When Zāl received the letter he said to his son Rostam: ''The king is in peril, and only you can save him.','claim.v0350.shn_seven.03',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_mazinderan.4','storyver.persian.zimmern_mazinderan',4,'沙漠中的公羊','The ram in the desert','第二天，鲁斯塔姆走进了一片炎热的沙漠，烈日像火一样烤着大地，四周没有一滴水，也没有一片树荫。','The next day Rostam entered a scorching desert; the sun burned the earth like fire, and there was not a drop of water nor a patch of shade.','claim.v0350.shn_seven.04',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_mazinderan.5','storyver.persian.zimmern_mazinderan',5,'恶龙','The dragon','那天夜里，鲁斯塔姆睡在泉水边，叮嘱拉赫什：不要再自己去和野兽打斗，有危险就叫醒我。','That night Rostam slept by the spring, telling Rakhsh not to fight beasts alone again but to wake him at any danger.','claim.v0350.shn_seven.05',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_mazinderan.6','storyver.persian.zimmern_mazinderan',6,'女巫','The witch','第四天，鲁斯塔姆穿过一片美丽的山谷，来到一眼泉水边，只见树荫下铺着华丽的毯子，摆满了烤好的羊肉、面包、水果和一瓶美酒，旁边还放着一把琴。','On the fourth day Rostam crossed a lovely valley to a spring, where beneath the trees rich carpets were spread with roast lamb, bread, fruit and a flask of wine, and a lute lay beside them.','claim.v0350.shn_seven.06',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_mazinderan.7','storyver.persian.zimmern_mazinderan',7,'乌拉德','Olād','第五天，鲁斯塔姆走进了一片没有日月、伸手不见五指的黑暗之地，他让拉赫什自己找路，走了很久，终于重见光明，来到一片绿油油的田野。','On the fifth day Rostam entered a land of darkness without sun or moon, where he could not see his hand before him; he let Rakhsh find the way, and after a long time came out into the light, to green fields.','claim.v0350.shn_seven.07',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_mazinderan.8','storyver.persian.zimmern_mazinderan',8,'阿尔章魔','The demon Arzhang','乌拉德带着鲁斯塔姆向前走，告诉他：前面是魔鬼阿尔章的营地，他是马赞德兰魔鬼军队的首领之一，守着通往国王监牢的道路；过了那里，再往前是七座大山，白魔就住在山中的一个洞穴里，他身边有成千上万的魔鬼守卫。','Olād led Rostam on and told him: ''Ahead is the camp of the demon Arzhang, one of the chiefs of the demon host of Māzandarān, who guards the road to the king''s prison; beyond it lie seven great mountains, and in a cave among them lives the White Demon with thousands of demons on guard.'' Rostam tied Olād to a tree, waited for dawn, then rode alone on Rakhsh into Arzhang''s camp with a roar like thunder that shook the demons'' hearts.','claim.v0350.shn_seven.08',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_mazinderan.9','storyver.persian.zimmern_mazinderan',9,'白魔的洞穴','The White Demon''s cave','鲁斯塔姆找到了被关押的凯·卡乌斯和伊朗的勇士们，他们都瞎了眼睛，在黑暗中受苦。','Rostam found Kay Kāvus and the champions of Iran in their prison, all blind and suffering in darkness.','claim.v0350.shn_seven.09',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_mazinderan.10','storyver.persian.zimmern_mazinderan',10,'重见光明','Sight restored','鲁斯塔姆带着白魔的肝走出洞穴，阳光照在他满是鲜血的身上，乌拉德看见他，吓得以为是魔鬼出来了，直到他开口说话才放下心来。','Rostam came out of the cave with the White Demon''s liver, the sunlight on his blood-soaked body; Olād, seeing him, took him for a demon and was terrified until he spoke.','claim.v0350.shn_seven.10',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_mazinderan.11','storyver.persian.zimmern_mazinderan',11,'化为岩石的国王','The king who became a rock','凯·卡乌斯恢复了力量，写信给马赞德兰的国王，命令他前来投降，交出财宝，做伊朗的属国。','Restored to strength, Kay Kāvus wrote to the king of Māzandarān commanding him to come and submit, surrender his treasure and become a vassal of Iran.','claim.v0350.shn_seven.11',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_mazinderan.12','storyver.persian.zimmern_mazinderan',12,'飞天的宝座','The flying throne','可是凯·卡乌斯并没有因为这次教训变得谨慎。','But Kay Kāvus did not grow cautious from this lesson.','claim.v0350.shn_seven.12',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_rustem_sohrab.1','storyver.persian.zimmern_rustem_sohrab',1,'丢失的拉赫什','Rakhsh is lost','有一天，鲁斯塔姆心中烦闷，就带上弓箭和套索，骑着拉赫什到伊朗与图兰交界的地方去打猎。','One day, restless in heart, Rostam took his bow and lasso and rode Rakhsh to hunt on the border between Iran and Tūrān.','claim.v0350.shn_sohrab.01',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_rustem_sohrab.2','storyver.persian.zimmern_rustem_sohrab',2,'塔米娜的夜访','Tahmineh comes by night','萨曼甘的国王为鲁斯塔姆举行了盛大的宴会，鲁斯塔姆喝了酒，被领到一间铺着锦缎的卧室里休息。','The king of Samangān held a great feast for Rostam, and when he had drunk he was led to a chamber hung with brocade to rest.','claim.v0350.shn_sohrab.02',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_rustem_sohrab.3','storyver.persian.zimmern_rustem_sohrab',3,'留下的信物','The token left behind','婚后不久，人们找回了拉赫什，鲁斯塔姆必须回到伊朗去了。','Soon after the marriage Rakhsh was found, and Rostam had to return to Iran.','claim.v0350.shn_sohrab.03',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_rustem_sohrab.4','storyver.persian.zimmern_rustem_sohrab',4,'苏赫拉布的成长','Sohrāb grows up','苏赫拉布长得出奇地快：一个月大时就像一岁的孩子，三岁时就学会了骑马射箭，五岁时有了狮子般的勇气，到了十岁，萨曼甘没有一个人能和他比武。','Sohrāb grew astonishingly fast: at one month he was like a child of a year, at three he rode and shot, at five he had a lion''s courage, and at ten no one in Samangān could match him in arms.','claim.v0350.shn_sohrab.04',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_rustem_sohrab.5','storyver.persian.zimmern_rustem_sohrab',5,'阿夫拉西亚布的阴谋','Afrāsiyāb''s plot','苏赫拉布为自己挑选了一匹配得上他的骏马，召集了一支军队。','Sohrāb chose himself a horse worthy of him and gathered an army.','claim.v0350.shn_sohrab.05',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_rustem_sohrab.6','storyver.persian.zimmern_rustem_sohrab',6,'白堡的女战士','The warrior maiden of the White Castle','苏赫拉布率领大军进入伊朗，来到边境上的白堡。','Sohrāb led his army into Iran and came to the White Castle on the border.','claim.v0350.shn_sohrab.06',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_rustem_sohrab.7','storyver.persian.zimmern_rustem_sohrab',7,'国王的召唤','The king''s summons','白堡失守的消息传到凯·卡乌斯那里，国王惊恐万分，立刻写信给鲁斯塔姆，派勇士吉夫日夜兼程送到扎布尔斯坦，请他火速前来抵挡这个年轻的敌人。','When news of the White Castle''s fall reached Kay Kāvus, the king was terrified and at once wrote to Rostam, sending the champion Gīv riding day and night to Zābulistān to beg him to come with all speed against the young enemy.','claim.v0350.shn_sohrab.07',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_rustem_sohrab.8','storyver.persian.zimmern_rustem_sohrab',8,'营帐边的夜探','Night in the enemy camp','伊朗大军来到白堡前，与图兰军队隔着平原对阵。','The Iranian army came before the White Castle and faced the Turanians across the plain.','claim.v0350.shn_sohrab.08',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_rustem_sohrab.9','storyver.persian.zimmern_rustem_sohrab',9,'第一天','The first day','苏赫拉布骑马冲到伊朗军前，大声挑战，又冲进营中，砍倒了凯·卡乌斯帐前的旗帜，伊朗的勇士们没有一个敢出来应战。','Sohrāb rode up before the Iranian host and shouted his challenge, then charged into the camp and cut down the banner before Kay Kāvus''s tent, and not one Iranian champion dared come out.','claim.v0350.shn_sohrab.09',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_rustem_sohrab.10','storyver.persian.zimmern_rustem_sohrab',10,'第二天的计谋','The ruse of the second day','第二天，苏赫拉布一见到鲁斯塔姆，就笑着迎上去说：昨夜你睡得好吗？','On the second day, as soon as Sohrāb saw Rostam he came to meet him smiling: ''Did you sleep well?','claim.v0350.shn_sohrab.10',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_rustem_sohrab.11','storyver.persian.zimmern_rustem_sohrab',11,'第三天','The third day','鲁斯塔姆脱身以后，来到一条溪边，洗净了身体，跪在地上向造物主祈祷。','Having escaped, Rostam went to a stream, washed himself, knelt and prayed to the Creator.','claim.v0350.shn_sohrab.11',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.persian_zimmern_rustem_sohrab.12','storyver.persian.zimmern_rustem_sohrab',12,'长生药与哀悼','The elixir and the mourning','鲁斯塔姆听见这句话，眼前一黑，昏倒在地。','At these words the world went dark before Rostam''s eyes and he fell senseless.','claim.v0350.shn_sohrab.12',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.chinese_soushenji_selected_13.1','storyver.chinese.soushenji_selected_13',1,'董永与织女','Dong Yong and the Weaving Maiden','汉朝的时候，千乘县有一个人叫董永。','In the Han dynasty there was a man of Qiancheng named Dong Yong.','claim.v0350.soushenji.01',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.chinese_soushenji_selected_13.2','storyver.chinese.soushenji_selected_13',2,'干将莫邪','Gan Jiang and Mo Ye','楚国的干将和莫邪为楚王铸剑，用了三年才铸成。','Gan Jiang and Mo Ye of Chu forged swords for the king of Chu, and it took them three years.','claim.v0350.soushenji.02',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.chinese_soushenji_selected_13.3','storyver.chinese.soushenji_selected_13',3,'三王墓','The Tomb of the Three Kings','楚王梦见一个少年，两眉之间宽一尺，说要来报仇。','The king of Chu dreamed of a boy with a foot''s breadth between his brows who said he would take vengeance, and the king offered a thousand pieces of gold for him.','claim.v0350.soushenji.03',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.chinese_soushenji_selected_13.4','storyver.chinese.soushenji_selected_13',4,'范巨卿与张元伯','Fan Juqing and Zhang Yuanbo','汉朝的范式，字巨卿，是山阳金乡人，和汝南的张劭是好朋友，张劭字元伯。','In the Han dynasty Fan Shi, styled Juqing, of Jinxiang in Shanyang, was a close friend of Zhang Shao of Runan, styled Yuanbo.','claim.v0350.soushenji.04',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.chinese_soushenji_selected_13.5','storyver.chinese.soushenji_selected_13',5,'东海孝妇','The filial widow of Donghai','汉朝的时候，东海郡有一位孝顺的媳妇，奉养婆婆非常尽心。','In the Han dynasty there was in Donghai commandery a filial daughter-in-law who served her mother-in-law with great devotion.','claim.v0350.soushenji.05',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.chinese_soushenji_selected_13.6','storyver.chinese.soushenji_selected_13',6,'韩凭夫妇','Han Ping and his wife','宋康王的舍人韩凭，娶了何氏为妻，何氏非常美丽，宋康王就把她夺了去。','Han Ping, a retainer of King Kang of Song, married a woman of the He family who was very beautiful, and King Kang took her from him.','claim.v0350.soushenji.06',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.chinese_soushenji_selected_13.7','storyver.chinese.soushenji_selected_13',7,'嫦娥奔月','Chang''e flees to the moon','后羿向西王母求得了长生不死的药，他的妻子姮娥——后来人们多写作嫦娥——偷了这药，奔向月亮。','Yi obtained from the Queen Mother of the West the drug of deathlessness, and his wife Heng''e — later more often written Chang''e — stole it and fled to the moon.','claim.v0350.soushenji.07',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.chinese_soushenji_selected_13.8','storyver.chinese.soushenji_selected_13',8,'女化蚕','The girl who became a silkworm','古老的传说讲：远古的时候，有一个人出远门去征战，家里没有别人，只剩下一个女儿和一匹公马，女儿亲自喂养这匹马。','An old tale says: in high antiquity a man went far away to war, leaving at home only his daughter and a stallion, which she tended herself.','claim.v0350.soushenji.08',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.chinese_soushenji_selected_13.9','storyver.chinese.soushenji_selected_13',9,'毛衣女','The women in feather robes','豫章郡新喻县有一个男子，看见田里有六七个女子，都穿着羽毛做的衣服，他不知道她们其实是鸟。','A man of Xinyu county in Yuzhang saw six or seven women in a field, all in robes of feathers, not knowing that they were birds.','claim.v0350.soushenji.09',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.chinese_soushenji_selected_13.10','storyver.chinese.soushenji_selected_13',10,'紫玉与韩重','Ziyu and Han Zhong','吴王夫差的小女儿名叫紫玉，十八岁，才华和容貌都很出众。','Ziyu, youngest daughter of King Fuchai of Wu, was eighteen, outstanding in talent and beauty.','claim.v0350.soushenji.10',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.chinese_soushenji_selected_13.11','storyver.chinese.soushenji_selected_13',11,'宋定伯卖鬼','Song Dingbo sells a ghost','南阳有个叫宋定伯的人，年轻的时候，有一次夜里赶路，遇到了一个鬼。','Song Dingbo of Nanyang, when he was young, was walking at night and met a ghost.','claim.v0350.soushenji.11',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.chinese_soushenji_selected_13.12','storyver.chinese.soushenji_selected_13',12,'李寄斩蛇','Li Ji slays the serpent','东越闽中有一座庸岭，高几十里，岭的西北山谷里住着一条大蛇，长七八丈，粗十几围，当地人都很害怕。','In Minzhong of Eastern Yue there is a ridge called Yongling, tens of li high, and in a valley to its northwest lived a great serpent seven or eight zhang long and more than ten spans round, which the local people dreaded.','claim.v0350.soushenji.12',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.chinese_soushenji_selected_13.13','storyver.chinese.soushenji_selected_13',13,'义犬冢','The tomb of the faithful dog','三国孙权的时候，襄阳纪南有一个人叫李信纯，家里养了一条狗，名叫黑龙，他非常喜爱这条狗，走到哪里都带着它，吃饭喝酒的时候也总分给它一份。','In the time of Sun Quan there lived in Jinan in Xiangyang a man named Li Xinchun who kept a dog called Black Dragon.','claim.v0350.soushenji.13',NULL,NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect1_10.1','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect1_10',1,'天地初开','When heaven and earth began','《古事记》的正文从天地开辟写起。','The Kojiki proper opens at the time when heaven and earth first began.','claim.v0350.kojiki_izanagi.01','event.japanese.izanagi_visits_yomi',NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect1_10.2','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect1_10',2,'神世七代','The seven divine generations','接着出现的是国之常立神和丰云野神，他们也是独自出现、隐去身形的神。','Next came into being Kuni-no-toko-tachi and Toyo-kumo-nu, who also came alone and hid their persons.','claim.v0350.kojiki_izanagi.02','event.japanese.izanagi_visits_yomi',NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect1_10.3','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect1_10',3,'淤能碁吕岛','The island of Onogoro','天上的众神一齐命令伊邪那岐和伊邪那美：去把这片漂浮的国土整治好，使它坚固，把它生出来。','All the heavenly deities commanded Izanagi and Izanami to make, consolidate and give birth to the drifting land — three tasks that the rest of the story works through one by one — and granted them a jewelled spear, the Ame-no-nuhoko.','claim.v0350.kojiki_izanagi.03','event.japanese.izanagi_visits_yomi',NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect1_10.4','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect1_10',4,'天之御柱与水蛭子','The heavenly pillar and the leech-child','两位神在岛上竖起了一根天之御柱，又建起一座八寻殿——“寻”是两臂张开的长度，八寻就是极言其宽大。','On the island they set up a heavenly pillar and built a hall eight fathoms wide.','claim.v0350.kojiki_izanagi.04','event.japanese.izanagi_visits_yomi',NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect1_10.5','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect1_10',5,'重新绕柱，生下大八岛','The Great Eight Islands','两位神商量说：我们生的孩子不好，应该去问问天上的众神。','The two took counsel: ''The children we have borne are not good.','claim.v0350.kojiki_izanagi.05','event.japanese.izanagi_visits_yomi',NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect1_10.6','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect1_10',6,'众神诞生','The birth of the deities','生完了国土，伊邪那岐和伊邪那美又接着生神。','Having borne the lands, Izanagi and Izanami went on to bear deities, and the text records each name: Oho-koto-oshi-wo, Iha-tsuchi-biko, Iha-su-hime, Oho-to-hi-wake, Ame-no-fuki-wo, Oho-ya-biko, Kaza-mo-tsu-wake-no-oshi-wo; the great sea deity Oho-wata-tsu-mi; the river-mouth deities Haya-aki-tsu-hiko and Haya-aki-tsu-hime, who in turn bore deities of foam and of the water''s surface; the wind deity Shina-tsu-hiko, the tree deity Kuku-no-chi, the great mountain deity Oho-yama-tsu-mi and the moor goddess Kaya-nu-hime, also called Nu-dzu-chi, who together bore deities of earth, mist and valleys.','claim.v0350.kojiki_izanagi.06','event.japanese.izanagi_visits_yomi',NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect1_10.7','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect1_10',7,'火神之火','The fire deity','最后，伊邪那美生下了火之迦具土神，也叫火之夜艺速男神、火之炫毘古神。','Last of all Izanami bore the fire deity Kagutsuchi, also called Hi-no-yagi-haya-wo and Hi-no-kaga-biko.','claim.v0350.kojiki_izanagi.07','event.japanese.izanagi_visits_yomi',NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect1_10.8','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect1_10',8,'哀哭与斩杀火神','Mourning and the slaying of the fire deity','伊邪那岐悲痛地说：我亲爱的妹妹啊，我怎么能用你换来这一个孩子！','Izanagi cried: ''Oh my beloved younger sister!','claim.v0350.kojiki_izanagi.08','event.japanese.izanagi_visits_yomi',NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect1_10.9','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect1_10',9,'黄泉：不要看我','Yomi: do not look at me','伊邪那岐思念妻子，追到了黄泉国。','Wishing to see his wife again, Izanagi followed her to the Land of Yomi.','claim.v0350.kojiki_izanagi.09','event.japanese.izanagi_visits_yomi',NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect1_10.10','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect1_10',10,'黄泉丑女与三个桃子','The Ugly Females of Yomi and the three peaches','伊邪那岐看见这副情景，吓得转身就逃。','Terrified at the sight, Izanagi turned and fled.','claim.v0350.kojiki_izanagi.10','event.japanese.izanagi_visits_yomi',NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect1_10.11','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect1_10',11,'千引石前的诀别','Farewell at the thousand-draught rock','最后，伊邪那美亲自追来了。','Last of all Izanami herself came in pursuit.','claim.v0350.kojiki_izanagi.11','event.japanese.izanagi_visits_yomi',NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('storyevent.v0350.japanese_kojiki_sect1_10.12','storyver.japanese.kojiki_sect1_10',12,'禊祓与三贵子','Purification and the three noble children','伊邪那岐说：我去了一个丑恶污秽的国家，必须洗净我的身体。','''I have been to a hideous and polluted land,'' said Izanagi, ''so I must purify my body.'' He came to the plain of Ahagi by the river-mouth of Tachibana in Himuka in Tsukushi and performed purification.','claim.v0350.kojiki_izanagi.12','event.japanese.izanagi_visits_yomi',NULL,'UNSPECIFIED','NO_COORDINATE','SOURCE_BACKED',NULL,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z');

UPDATE stories SET reading_minutes=10,updated_at='2026-10-24T18:00:00Z' WHERE id='story.japanese.izanagi_izanami' AND reading_minutes<10;

UPDATE stories SET editorial_note='长篇版本依据张伯伦 1882 年英译《古事记》第一至十节（sacred-texts 页码 kj008–kj017）逐节讲述；原有的第三至十节短版本保留。《日本书纪》的不同说法另行保存，不合并。',updated_at='2026-10-24T18:00:00Z' WHERE id='story.japanese.izanagi_izanami';



INSERT OR IGNORE INTO story_series(
    id,title_zh,title_en,work_entity_id,primary_source_id,primary_civilization_id,description_zh,description_en,selection_note,featured_order,created_at,updated_at
) VALUES
('series.japanese.kojiki','古事记连载','The Kojiki (series)','text.japanese.kojiki','source.japanese.kojiki.chamberlain','civ.japanese_shinto','按张伯伦英译《古事记》的节次连读五部：伊邪那岐与伊邪那美、天之岩户与八岐大蛇、大国主、天孙降临与海神之宫、倭建命，共六十五章。','Chamberlain''s translation of the Kojiki read in five parts by section: Izanagi and Izanami, the rock-cave and the serpent, Ōkuninushi, the descent of the August Grandchild and the sea palace, and Yamato Takeru — sixty-five chapters in all.','前四部连续覆盖上卷第一至四十三节；第五部跳到中卷景行天皇纪的倭建命故事，跳过的节次在该部写明。中卷其余部分与下卷暂未收录。',10,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z','2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('series.finnish.kalevala','卡勒瓦拉连载','The Kalevala (series)','text.finnish.kalevala','source.finnish.kalevala_crawford.gutenberg','civ.finnish','按克劳福德英译《卡勒瓦拉》的诗章连读四部：创世与三宝（第一至十章）、勒明凯宁（第十一至十五章）、库勒沃（第三十一至三十六章）、夺取三宝（第三十九至四十三章），共四十八章。','Crawford''s translation of the Kalevala read in four parts by rune: the making of the world and the Sampo (Runes I–X), Lemminkäinen (XI–XV), Kullervo (XXXI–XXXVI) and the theft of the Sampo (XXXIX–XLIII) — forty-eight chapters in all.','四部按诗章顺序排列，中间跳过的诗章在各部写明；第四十四至五十章（第二把康特勒琴、洛希的灾祸、偷走日月与玛利亚塔）暂未收录。',11,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z','2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('series.hindu.mahabharata_tales','摩诃婆罗多连载','The Mahābhārata (series)','text.indian.mahabharata','source.indian.mahabharata_ganguli.sacredtexts','civ.hindu','按甘古利英译《摩诃婆罗多》的篇章顺序连读三部：森林篇中的那罗与达摩衍蒂、莎维德丽，以及从斡旋篇到夜袭篇的俱卢之野大战，共三十九章。','Ganguli''s translation of the Mahābhārata read in three parts in the order of the books: Nala and Damayantī and Sāvitrī from the Forest Book, and the war at Kurukṣetra from the Udyoga to the Sauptika Parva — thirty-nine chapters in all.','前两部是般度五子流放森林时听到的插话故事，第三部是全书主线的战争；三部之间跳过的篇章在各部写明。《初篇》《大会篇》中的掷骰与其后的各篇暂未收录。',12,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z','2026-10-24T18:00:00Z'),
('series.persian.shahnameh_rostam','列王纪连载','The Shahnameh (series)','text.persian.shahnameh','source.persian.epic_of_kings_zimmern','civ.persian','按齐默恩英文散文转述本《列王纪》的顺序连读三部：扎尔与鲁达贝、鲁斯塔姆的七关、鲁斯塔姆与苏赫拉布，共三十六章。','Zimmern''s prose retelling of the Shahnameh read in three parts: Zāl and Rūdābeh, the seven stages of Rostam, and Rostam and Sohrāb — thirty-six chapters in all.','三部依据齐默恩转述本中相连的几节，不是菲尔多西原诗的完整译本；转述本开头的上古诸王、佐哈克与法里东，以及苏赫拉布之后的故事暂未收录。',13,'2026-10-24T18:00:00Z','2026-10-24T18:00:00Z');

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO story_series_parts(
    series_id,part_order,story_id,part_label_zh,part_label_en,source_span,gap_note
) VALUES
('series.japanese.kojiki',1,'story.japanese.izanagi_izanami','第一部 · 伊邪那岐与伊邪那美','Part 1: Izanagi and Izanami','Sect. I–X',NULL),
('series.japanese.kojiki',2,'story.japanese.iwato_orochi','第二部 · 天之岩户与八岐大蛇','Part 2: the rock-cave and the serpent','Sect. XI–XIX',NULL),
('series.japanese.kojiki',3,'story.japanese.okuninushi','第三部 · 大国主','Part 3: Ōkuninushi','Sect. XX–XXXII',NULL),
('series.japanese.kojiki',4,'story.japanese.ninigi_sea_palace','第四部 · 天孙降临与海神之宫','Part 4: the August Grandchild and the sea palace','Sect. XXXIII–XLIII',NULL),
('series.japanese.kojiki',5,'story.japanese.yamato_takeru','第五部 · 倭建命','Part 5: Yamato Takeru','Sect. LXXIX–XC','与上一部之间跳过第四十四至七十八节：神武天皇东征以及此后诸代天皇的记事，直到景行天皇纪的前三部分。'),
('series.finnish.kalevala',1,'story.finnish.kalevala_sampo_forging','第一部 · 创世与三宝','Part 1: the world and the Sampo','Runes I–X',NULL),
('series.finnish.kalevala',2,'story.finnish.kalevala_lemminkainen','第二部 · 勒明凯宁','Part 2: Lemminkäinen','Runes XI–XV',NULL),
('series.finnish.kalevala',3,'story.finnish.kalevala_kullervo','第三部 · 库勒沃','Part 3: Kullervo','Runes XXXI–XXXVI','与上一部之间跳过第十六至三十章：万奈莫宁造船、访问冥界与巨人维普宁，伊尔马里宁赢得波赫约拉的少女与婚礼，勒明凯宁闯宴与逃亡海岛等。'),
('series.finnish.kalevala',4,'story.finnish.kalevala_sampo_theft','第四部 · 夺取三宝','Part 4: the theft of the Sampo','Runes XXXIX–XLIII','与上一部之间跳过第三十七至三十八章：伊尔马里宁打造金女，又到波赫约拉求亲未成。'),
('series.hindu.mahabharata_tales',1,'story.hindu.nala_damayanti','第一部 · 那罗与达摩衍蒂','Part 1: Nala and Damayantī','Vana Parva LII–LXXIX',NULL),
('series.hindu.mahabharata_tales',2,'story.hindu.savitri_satyavan','第二部 · 莎维德丽','Part 2: Sāvitrī','Vana Parva CCXCI–CCXCVII','与上一部之间跳过森林篇第八十至二百九十节：般度五子的朝圣、阿周那从天界归来、《罗摩故事》的缩写等。'),
('series.hindu.mahabharata_tales',3,'story.hindu.kurukshetra_war','第三部 · 俱卢之野','Part 3: the field of the Kurus','Udyoga to Sauptika Parva','与上一部之间跳过森林篇的其余部分、毗罗吒篇（隐姓埋名的第十三年）与斡旋篇的大部分；战争各篇只择取主线。'),
('series.persian.shahnameh_rostam',1,'story.persian.zal_rudabeh_rostam','第一部 · 扎尔与鲁达贝','Part 1: Zāl and Rūdābeh','“Zal” to “Rustem”',NULL),
('series.persian.shahnameh_rostam',2,'story.persian.rostam_seven_labours','第二部 · 鲁斯塔姆的七关','Part 2: the seven stages of Rostam','“The March into Mazinderan”; “Kai Kaous Committeth More Follies”','本部只讲“凯·卡乌斯的更多愚行”中的飞天宝座一段，略去哈马瓦兰之战与苏达贝的故事。'),
('series.persian.shahnameh_rostam',3,'story.persian.rostam_sohrab','第三部 · 鲁斯塔姆与苏赫拉布','Part 3: Rostam and Sohrāb','“Rustem and Sohrab”',NULL);

